{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呼……呜，好困……」", "text_idx": 217, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn3875", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，你学到这么晚吗」", "text_idx": 220, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6525", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我通宵了，这次我很有干劲」", "text_idx": 222, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn3876", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「有干劲是好事，你可别在考试的时候睡着啊」", "text_idx": 224, "plain": "「有干劲是好事，你可别在考试的时候睡着啊」", "plain_idx": 224, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6526", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "即使有点距离，也能听到她们的对话。", "text_idx": 226, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一定跟昨晚我们电话打到很晚有关。", "text_idx": 227, "plain": "一定跟昨晚我们电话打到很晚有关。", "plain_idx": 227, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「说起来，天羽学姐好像也很困……」", "text_idx": 228, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1710", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「美羽学姐？」", "text_idx": 230, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，我碰巧在楼梯口遇到她。\\n　她好像很担心找不到熊喵」", "text_idx": 231, "plain": "「嗯，我碰巧在楼梯口遇到她。　她好像很担心找不到熊喵」", "plain_idx": 232, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1711", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「对哦，还没找到熊喵……」", "text_idx": 234, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哦，你知道的啊。说起来这几天是没看到熊喵啊……」", "text_idx": 235, "plain": "「哦，你知道的啊。说起来这几天是没看到熊喵啊……」", "plain_idx": 235, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1712", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学姐可能是因为担心一直在寻找熊喵。", "text_idx": 237, "plain": "学姐可能是因为担心一直在寻找熊喵。", "plain_idx": 237, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "希望熊喵没事……", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "总之，考试第一天很顺利。", "text_idx": 239, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾你之后打算做什么？」", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1713", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我先去趟活动室，有点担心熊喵」", "text_idx": 242, "plain": "「我先去趟活动室，有点担心熊喵」", "plain_idx": 242, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哦，那我也注意下，明天见」", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1714", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯」", "text_idx": 245, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "击了个掌，我和隼太说了再见。", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪已经不见了。", "text_idx": 247, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "今天我们都没怎么聊天。", "text_idx": 248, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "只是对视了几次。", "text_idx": 249, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "每次对视我们都会微笑。", "text_idx": 250, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「找到熊喵了吗？」", "text_idx": 251, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊」", "text_idx": 252, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "打开门后，我慌忙堵住自己嘴巴。", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "里面是一个人坐在椅子上趴着的纱凪。", "text_idx": 254, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "是因为熬夜了吗，到这里就是她的极限了。", "text_idx": 255, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯……」", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn3877", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我悄悄走过去，把外套披在她身上。", "text_idx": 258, "plain": "我悄悄走过去，把外套披在她身上。", "plain_idx": 258, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽说关着门，活动室还是很冷的。", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "差不多该准备暖炉了。", "text_idx": 260, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不过熊喵去哪里了啊」", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我离开活动室，开始室外作业。", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "平常熊喵都是很有精神地在活动室跑来跑去的。\\n这么久没见到，我担心它是不是遭遇了事故。", "text_idx": 263, "plain": "平常熊喵都是很有精神地在活动室跑来跑去的。这么久没见到，我担心它是不是遭遇了事故。", "plain_idx": 264, "len": 43, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不过真的很冷啊……」", "text_idx": 265, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我搓着手向兔子笼走去。", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "兔子本身就是容易积攒压力的动物，\\n对于环境变化它们尤其敏感。", "text_idx": 267, "plain": "兔子本身就是容易积攒压力的动物，对于环境变化它们尤其敏感。", "plain_idx": 268, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "饲料、水和粪便处理就不说了。\\n作为保温材料和地板用的干草也需要更换。", "text_idx": 269, "plain": "饲料、水和粪便处理就不说了。作为保温材料和地板用的干草也需要更换。", "plain_idx": 270, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而且不同兔子需要的饲料不同，\\n有些兔子吃了人吃的蔬菜就会吃坏肚子。", "text_idx": 271, "plain": "而且不同兔子需要的饲料不同，有些兔子吃了人吃的蔬菜就会吃坏肚子。", "plain_idx": 272, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "真的照顾起来还是很难的。", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然买了书，但不能应付所有情况。", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「早点精神起来哦」", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "回过神来，我已经开始像这样和动物们聊天了。", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "没有名字的兔子们。", "text_idx": 277, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "大家总有一天会离开这里。", "text_idx": 278, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们这些社团成员也是一样的。", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "明年美羽学姐会毕业，\\n并校的事定下来之后，我们也会毕业。", "text_idx": 280, "plain": "明年美羽学姐会毕业，并校的事定下来之后，我们也会毕业。", "plain_idx": 281, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这样一想，能和大家一起度过的时间真的很短。", "text_idx": 282, "plain": "这样一想，能和大家一起度过的时间真的很短。", "plain_idx": 282, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「得尽快传达我的心意……」", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我的脑海中突然浮现出纱凪的脸。", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "想听她的声音。", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呜哇？！」", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn3878", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「？！」", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "活动室突然传来我想听到的声音。", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「怎么了纱凪？！」", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……」", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn3879", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她好像刚醒过来的样子，表情显得有些茫然。", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这是平常的她所没有的表情，看起来有点让人心动。", "text_idx": 294, "plain": "这是平常的她所没有的表情，看起来有点让人心动。", "plain_idx": 294, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「原来是梦啊」", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn3880", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「突然听你惨叫吓到我了，是做噩梦了？」", "text_idx": 297, "plain": "「突然听你惨叫吓到我了，是做噩梦了？」", "plain_idx": 297, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「最糟糕的梦，想着是美羽学姐我就抱过去了……\\n　不知道为什么变成了新吾」", "text_idx": 298, "plain": "「最糟糕的梦，想着是美羽学姐我就抱过去了……　不知道为什么变成了新吾」", "plain_idx": 299, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn3881", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我还在你的梦里出现了啊」", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……嗯？这是你的外套吗？」", "text_idx": 302, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn3882", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊对，现在还挺冷的，\\n　你要是考试期间感冒就麻烦了……」", "text_idx": 304, "plain": "「啊对，现在还挺冷的，　你要是考试期间感冒就麻烦了……」", "plain_idx": 305, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……」", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn3883", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你好像还是很困，再休息会吧……\\n　我去外面干活」", "text_idx": 307, "plain": "「你好像还是很困，再休息会吧……　我去外面干活」", "plain_idx": 308, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「等、等一下，你说去外面……」", "text_idx": 309, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn3884", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪跑过来抓住我的手，把外套给我。", "text_idx": 311, "plain": "纱凪跑过来抓住我的手，把外套给我。", "plain_idx": 311, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「难道说你没穿外套，一直在外面干活？」", "text_idx": 312, "plain": "「难道说你没穿外套，一直在外面干活？」", "plain_idx": 312, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn3885", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是的，怎么了？」", "text_idx": 314, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……」", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn3886", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你真是够了」", "text_idx": 316, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn3887", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，这」", "text_idx": 318, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她握着我的手，一脸不满地看着我。", "text_idx": 319, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你自己看你的手有多冰，\\n　然后我抱怨后你是不是想回答“女孩子着凉对身体不好”」", "text_idx": 320, "plain": "「你自己看你的手有多冰，　然后我抱怨后你是不是想回答“女孩子着凉对身体不好”」", "plain_idx": 321, "len": 41, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn3888", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「大家都知道你的想法」", "text_idx": 323, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn3889", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但我担心你会不会感冒」", "text_idx": 325, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「够了，另一只手」", "text_idx": 326, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn3890", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，没事的。只是手冷不会死的」", "text_idx": 328, "plain": "「啊，没事的。只是手冷不会死的」", "plain_idx": 328, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你烦不烦，如果我欠你人情，我会死的」", "text_idx": 329, "plain": "「你烦不烦，如果我欠你人情，我会死的」", "plain_idx": 329, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn3891", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "说完，纱凪强行握住我另一只手。", "text_idx": 331, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她想把自己的温度传递给我。", "text_idx": 332, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，你的手指好长啊，和我的比一下？」", "text_idx": 333, "plain": "「嗯，你的手指好长啊，和我的比一下？」", "plain_idx": 333, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn3892", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯？」", "text_idx": 335, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呜哇，好大，你这手真不可爱」", "text_idx": 336, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn3893", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是你的手太小了」", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哈哈，是有女人味的，很可爱的手吧？」", "text_idx": 339, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn3894", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，是的」", "text_idx": 341, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……」", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn3895", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我开玩笑的，你这么认真回答我反而不知道怎么反应了」", "text_idx": 343, "plain": "「我开玩笑的，你这么认真回答我反而不知道怎么反应了」", "plain_idx": 343, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn3896", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪紧握住我的手，把头低了下去。", "text_idx": 345, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我的手心里残留着她的温度。", "text_idx": 346, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊对了，你在外面干活来着」", "text_idx": 347, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn3897", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是的，我在清扫兔子笼」", "text_idx": 349, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你一个人能做好吗？」", "text_idx": 350, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn3898", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那就让纱凪老师来看看吧」", "text_idx": 352, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好，重做！」", "text_idx": 353, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn3899", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「还没看就这样，好严啊」", "text_idx": 355, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「两个人一起做会更快。走吧，我们去外面」", "text_idx": 356, "plain": "「两个人一起做会更快。走吧，我们去外面」", "plain_idx": 356, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn3900", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「明白」", "text_idx": 358, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我和纱凪自然地把手握在一起。", "text_idx": 359, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "确实如她所说。", "text_idx": 360, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们两人一起，即使是室外作业。", "text_idx": 361, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "和她一起，就会很快，很开心。", "text_idx": 362, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「理央，你睡着了？」", "text_idx": 363, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn3901", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我醒着的」", "text_idx": 365, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ri0312", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「姐姐待会要去下活动室看看动物们的样子」", "text_idx": 367, "plain": "「姐姐待会要去下活动室看看动物们的样子」", "plain_idx": 367, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn3902", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你要老实睡觉哦？」", "text_idx": 369, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn3903", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你不说我也知道」", "text_idx": 371, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ri0313", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，在这之前要去厕所吗，\\n　姐姐不在的时候想去很麻烦的」", "text_idx": 373, "plain": "「啊，在这之前要去厕所吗，　姐姐不在的时候想去很麻烦的」", "plain_idx": 374, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn3904", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「没事的」", "text_idx": 376, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ri0314", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嘴上这么说，明明一个人不敢去～」", "text_idx": 378, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn3905", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 113, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我可以一个人去的，别把我当小孩」", "text_idx": 380, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ri0315", "char_id": "理央"}]}
